error[E3012]  a/a.canon:11:29
  keyed by b: the keys of ref a.bs loop back to it; key one list by a String, integer or enum field

error[E3012]  a/a.canon:12:28
  keyed by a: the keys of ref a.as1 loop back to it; key one list by a String, integer or enum field

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
